          ("Can I still get to my meter or fuse board?", "Yes. We plan access doors or a removable panel around meters, fuse boards, stopcocks and pipework so they stay easy to reach."),
          ("Will the drawers take heavy things like shoes and the vacuum?", "Yes. We use heavy-duty soft-close runners rated for real loads, and we plan a space for the vacuum, its charger and anything else that lives under the stairs."),
